{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_8_level_spst_08-02","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"spst_08-02","title":"燃燒的片段2","storyCode":"EG-2","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_spst_08-02.txt","sourceHash":"ae059c0618746ce3ad1c84559dd24633ad6cdcb706c979776875fb36fe8d735e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topout"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"切割，穿刺，劈砍，橫掃，利刃在敵人之中飛舞。\n哭喊，怒駡，詛咒，嚎叫，而後一切歸於平靜。\n迷迭香的表情沒有任何變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"解決了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"已經沒有陣地和伏擊點，可以繼續前進了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"幹得漂亮，菲林。我們的人甚至還沒有受傷就結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，你刺穿他們頭顱的速度很快，很準，很果斷，這樣很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是知道是你殺的大尉，我可能會希望你加入我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你是個天生的戰士，你跟著那隻卡特斯，很可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"不許你說阿米婭的壞話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我並沒有在批評她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"她說了一些我很久很久以前想聽，也聽過的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"她很好，菲林，她真好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，這行不通，菲林，這行不通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我不信，阿米婭一定能夠做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"或許吧，但你跟著她，對你對她都不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是兩類人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼兩類人？我和阿米婭關係很好，她教會了我許多事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵，你會懂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"裝神弄鬼......我也不想知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才說，我能加入你們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"我們歡迎任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你為感染者的命運感到不公，只要你對烏薩斯感到憤怒，只要你想要戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你就可以加入我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為我們的隊伍裡只有烏薩斯人，只有這個國家的子民？不是的，菲林。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......你也是菲林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"我生長在雷姆必拓，隨著父母來到烏薩斯，然後在這片寒冷的土地扎根。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"我從小喜歡和人打架，於是後來決定參軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然烏薩斯的參軍測驗對菲林來說有些嚴苛，但我還是成功了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，我進了大尉的部隊，我跟著大尉四處征戰，這一打，就是十年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"戰爭，緊跟著戰爭，還有下一場戰爭，這就是烏薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾經為這個國家感到驕傲，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"我們之中，有無數人都曾為這個國家感到驕傲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，為什麼......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我的父母感染了礦石病，被趕出了城市，死在了荒野上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"而我甚至在他們死後的半年後才知道這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"我們之中，有無數人經歷過類似的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽到你也經歷了類似的事情，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"但不只是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只是這樣，如果我只是湊巧不幸的那一個，我甚至或許可以理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，不是這樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"戰爭曾經是我腦中唯一存在且應該完成的事業。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"我在那時才開始思考一些事情，才開始去瞭解這個國家，去嘗試理解這個我曾為之奮鬥的國家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒有大尉，我可能已經因為在司令部出言不遜而進軍事法庭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，我跟著大尉走入了北原。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"而後一路走到了今天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"在這之中，我學會了忍耐，學會了憤怒，學會了憎恨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿米婭對我說，不要學會這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"你總會學會的，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你不會運用它們，你就會被它們吞沒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，愛國者是你的親人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"我們共同奮戰了二十年，他是我最好的兄弟，最親的戰友，最尊敬的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"他是，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"但我依然要說，你更適合加入我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"那阿米婭能夠加入你們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"那隻卡特斯？不，她不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"她不能加入我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"那我不會加入你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我也說了，因為你殺了大尉，你不可能加入我們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"但要我說的話，你要多注意一下她，她想要保護你，但她可能比你死得更快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼你這麼肯定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058_2","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我們曾經見過這樣的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"盾衛似乎回想起了什麼，不再理會迷迭香，重新戴上頭盔，向著他的戰友走去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
